<h2 id="frame" style="color:#1565c0;font-size:1.22em;font-weight:650;border-left:4px solid #42a5f5;padding-left:10px;margin-top:1.1em">1. Suite frame</h2>

Every **learner suite** wireframe in this repo uses these bands (generic §2.1 adapted):

```text
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│  Floor35 Language Learn                                                      │
├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│  ROW 1 — knowledge areas (`KnowledgeAreaNav`)                                │
│  [ Admin ▾ ]   [ Conjugations ]   [ {Area} ● ]   …   [ Profile ]            │
├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│  ROW 2 — suite bar (`SuiteSubNav`; hide if area has only one mode)           │
│  Basic knowledge ● │ Basic practice │ Paragraph practice                     │
├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│  PAGE BODY — existing page components; tabs/chips per area IA doc            │
├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│  FOOTER — practice routes only: [ Save My Workbench ]  user@email  [ Log out ]│
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

| Band | Component | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| Title | App h1 | Fixed copy |
| Row 1 | `KnowledgeAreaNav` | One button per **knowledge area**; **Admin ▾** is not suite bar |
| Row 2 | `SuiteSubNav` | **Basic knowledge** (A) · **Basic practice** (B.1) · **Paragraph practice** (B.2) |
| Body | Route `Outlet` | Reuse shipped pages where possible |
| Footer | `AdminNav` + `WorkbenchProvider` | Session + manual save on practice pages |

**Mermaid for this app:** Use generic §4 for **IA trees** (guide §1 pipelines, area catalog in v2 analysis) — not for row-level pixel layout.

