<h2 id="in-page" style="color:#1565c0;font-size:1.22em;font-weight:650;border-left:4px solid #42a5f5;padding-left:10px;margin-top:1.1em">4. In-page rules</h2>

Under **Basic knowledge**:

1. **Max 3–4 tabs**; overflow → **chips** inside a tab (generic §3).
2. Name chips from **§4.0 UI labels** or Integrated Guide sections — not DB table names or academic terms alone.
3. When redesigning, add a **guide § → tab/chip** table under the wireframe ([`ANALYSIS_REEVALUATE_DESIGN_v2.md`](../../cursor_gen/refactor_plans/new/new_pages/ANALYSIS_REEVALUATE_DESIGN_v2.md) §4.2).
4. Optional: **How to choose ▾** → Procedures A–E (guide §11).

