<h2 id="routes" style="color:#1565c0;font-size:1.22em;font-weight:650;border-left:4px solid #42a5f5;padding-left:10px;margin-top:1.1em">5. Route legend</h2>

| Suite bar label | Route pattern | Logical role |
|---|---|---|
| Basic knowledge | `/knowledge/{slug}` | A — read / explore |
| Basic practice | `/practice/{slug}` | B.1 — drills |
| Paragraph practice | `/practice/{slug}/paragraph` | B.2 — in context |

**Slugs:** per v2 §4.1 (internal). **Nav labels:** per v2 §4.0.1 — lay term plus `(academic)` when space allows (e.g. slug `clitics` → nav **me, te, se (clitics)**). Legacy `/knowledge/gender-nouns` → migrate to v2 slugs in new docs.

**Admin ▾** (row 1 dropdown, not suite bar): Verbs · Chapter Builder · Paragraph admin · LLM Cost — see paradigm alignment §3.3.

